# Netlify SPA fallback.
#
# Vite copies everything in public/ into dist/, so this lands at dist/_redirects
# and is picked up automatically at deploy time. Without it, refreshing a
# client-side route such as /history or /security returns a 404, because
# Netlify looks for a real file at that path.
#
# The vercel.json in this repo does the same job for Vercel, so the app can
# be deployed to either host unchanged.
/*    /index.html   200
